  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: Now there's one more item we need - and they definitely ain't selling it at the hardware store...
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: 'We''ll need an <h1>OG Kush seed</h>. For that, you''ll have to pay a visit to the local shady marketplace AKA the <h1>warehouse</h>. '
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: It's that big brick building near where you sold to Kevin earlier. It's only open from <h1>6pm to 6am</h>, so pass some time if you have to, then head over there.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
